PCB design 
PCB concept for your EchoMinded Robot, designed around an Arduino-compatible controller with sensor and motor connections.
Important: This is a visual concept, not a verified manufacturing-ready PCB. Before making the physical board in KiCad 10.0, the schematic, footprints, power supply, and PCB tracks must be checked.
The design includes:
- Arduino-compatible ATmega328P controller
- L298N motor-driver section
- Ultrasonic sensor connector
- MQ-2 gas sensor connector
- Temperature and rain sensor connectors
- RGB LED, buzzer, and servo connectors
- Battery input and 5V regulator
